      "id": "DELL-KB-000211906",
      "effect": "Dell reports incorrect Flux time-range behavior in ECS 3.8.0; returned values can represent cumulative totals rather than the requested range.",
      "mitigation": "Only consume last() snapshots and monotonic counters. Disable Exporter-derived interval rates for this Profile."
    },
    {
      "id": "DELL-KB-000205031",
      "effect": "Management API requests through a proxy or load balancer can return HTTP 403 when Host is absent from accepted server names.",
      "mitigation": "Keep configured URL hostname, TLS SNI and HTTP Host consistent; document accepted server names as a deployment prerequisite."
    },
    {
      "id": "ECS380-REST-REFERENCE-PENDING",
      "effect": "The official REST API ZIP is listed by Dell but requires an authenticated support session and has not been reviewed in this repository.",
      "mitigation": "Treat management mappings inherited from 3.6 as candidates and block sandbox certification until the 3.8.0 ZIP and live responses are compared."
    }
  ],
